  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252filyrac\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f69e87c0cfd3306fa11c3da477e51544c8d380e2_0.webp\" alt=\"支持我\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/ilyrac/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rpoyjVG.png\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252filyrac\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7fioiRx.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/IlyRac/FarBlockEntityRendering\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EYNx6oL.png\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a></p><hr><h1>Terracart – 地形礦車</h1><p>貼近原版風格的可駕駛礦車——跳上車、用<strong>煤炭</strong>補充燃料、用<strong>鐵</strong>修復、從<strong>16種顏色</strong>中挑選一款，在您的世界中自由穿梭。</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9bf9852c021c9342a5ab7f016fdca0049a414a02.gif\" alt=\"動態展示-1\"></p><hr><h2>✨ 特色功能</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>駕駛系統</strong>：可騎乘礦車，具備流暢移動機制。</li>\n<li><strong>燃料機制</strong>：<strong>僅在移動時消耗燃料</strong>，使用<strong>煤炭</strong>補充。</li>\n<li><strong>維修系統</strong>：使用<strong>鐵</strong>進行修復。</li>\n<li><strong>色彩自訂</strong>：可選擇<strong>16種顏色</strong>之一。</li>\n<li><strong>生存模式平衡</strong>：礦車損毀時掉落<strong>原材料</strong>：<strong>3-7個鐵</strong>、<strong>1個車輪</strong>、<strong>1個熔爐</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>介面顯示</strong>：駕駛時顯示<em>速度/燃料/耐久度</em>狀態介面。</li>\n<li><strong>音效與粒子</strong>：自訂音效與碰撞粒子提供清晰反饋。</li>\n<li><strong>碰撞傷害</strong>：礦車撞擊時對生物造成傷害。</li>\n<li><strong>原版融合設計</strong>：設計理念貼近原版遊戲風格。</li>\n</ul><hr><h2>🎮 使用指南</h2><ol>\n<li>合成地形礦車，放置前可<strong>選擇顏色</strong>（可選）。</li>\n<li>將已染色礦車放入熔爐燒製可<strong>還原為預設礦車物品</strong>。<ul>\n<li><strong>注意：</strong>礦車<strong>不會</strong>直接掉落自身物品。變更顏色需重新合成礦車（或放置前先燒製還原）。</li></ul></li>\n<li>右鍵點擊乘坐礦車。</li>\n<li>使用標準移動鍵駕駛。</li>\n<li>移動時使用<strong>煤炭</strong>補充燃料（燃料僅在移動時消耗）。</li>\n<li>受損時使用<strong>鐵</strong>進行修復。</li>\n<li>若礦車<strong>完全損毀</strong>，收集掉落材料重新製作。</li>\n<li>盡情探索世界，享受駕駛樂趣。</li>\n</ol><hr><h2>🖼️ 展示圖庫</h2><p>截圖取自<strong>Shiomate</strong>創建的<strong>Umihara City</strong>地圖——衷心感謝！</p><p>地圖：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fproject%252fumiharacity%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Umihara City 海原</a> —— 創作者：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fshiomate%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shiomate</a></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b5029c90c6e33eae7a0951e5b5fc05f3725ded28.png\" alt=\"停車展示\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/addf2fc627b7053fa68a06b385e87776a53fd7eb_0.webp\" alt=\"道路行駛\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3c8c5af5d7d9b7b6cc5186d5e76f69525393c78b.png\" alt=\"全色系展示\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/82f40934f48fef0304f7a7dc6c9ac53d9bc74a0c_0.webp\" alt=\"動態展示-2\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a1f85e7659e81beed9cb29dfebdeaa32e6a2115a_0.webp\" alt=\"騎乘視角\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/acfbb3962e53474cdf42612ce5f1463e740ba109_0.webp\" alt=\"俯視圖\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2d0e4e26df59584e9c751d174e554db2a8f6871f.png\" alt=\"合成配方\"></p><hr>",
